From 92a765844efdbea191d08185758d75b8fc6e287b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: odin-port <odin@port.local>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:08:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] drm/panel: add Smartisan ODIN FocalTech FT8716 1080p DSI
 panel driver

Add support for the FocalTech FT8716 TDDI-based 1080x1920 video mode
panels found in the Smartisan ODIN, including the Sharp module
variant with its distinct initialization sequence.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
